  plan implements it exactly; do not add scope beyond it (no
  `harper.js`/WASM, no Markdown front-matter handling, no per-key
  configuration, no `default_config.json` change).
- Heuristic thresholds are fixed by the spec: word count >= 3;
  reject URL/path/version-shaped values; reject
